<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.7 /10.6     11.2 /11.10    11.6 /11.5</p>
<p>BPI			10.65 /10.625  11.125 /11.075 11.515 /11.47</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.7 /10.625   11.125/11.05   11.55 /11.50</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	 10.725/10.625  11.125/11.025  11.55/11.45</p>
<p>SolidBank		10.65 /10.6    11.1/11.04     11.6 /11.5</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.65 /10.575  11.075 /11.005 11.55 /11.475</p>
<p>PNB			10.7 /10.6     11.15/11.0     11.55/11.45</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
